CHANGES MADE IN THIS FORK
-------------------------

Fulcra 0.1.0 is Paseo 0.9.1 with: the Fulcra name and artwork in the app,
desktop app and CLI (`fulcra`, with `paseo` kept as an alias); `FULCRA_HOME`
(with `PASEO_HOME` as a fallback); session defaults (new Claude sessions store
their default permission mode, model and effort); Claude model discovery from
the installed Claude Code; project names instead of ids in the new-workspace
picker; "Not installed" for providers whose CLI is missing; and the other
fixes recorded in the git history. Internal identifiers such as the
`@getpaseo/*` package names are unchanged so upstream changes keep merging;
see docs/UPSTREAM.md.

